  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "整合运动还真是......精力旺盛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们，是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么会这个时候，出现在切尔诺伯格！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "哈？怎，怎么回事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "间谍吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（如果泄露了身份，被乌萨斯当局盯上，后果不堪设想！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（必要的话......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——小女孩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别动！放下武器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（做好防护准备，一旦对方有敌对倾向......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（烟雾？从哪里......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "先生，对我们抱有敌意的人究竟是谁，你应该很清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "杜宾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "重装干员！敌袭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什，什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......整合运动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "阿米娅，小心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "她和那些普通的感染者暴徒，不是一回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，逃跑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又能逃到哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去，撕碎他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "就连手下的整合运动成员也是一副训练有素的样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "难道是，整合运动的头目吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "雾气越来越浓了......想借助雾气发动奇袭吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "军警先生，我们必须立刻撤离这个区域！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果让他们封锁了我们的退路，我们就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们这些感染者，都给我滚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得到的命令是防卫这条大街。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染兔子，我不管你们来这里有什么目的，想干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你们是来破坏我们的城市的，自然会有人惩罚你们。乌萨斯的愤怒是无休止的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是，那这里发生的事情，和你没有关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每个乌萨斯人都知道，不把背脊朝向敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快滚！我们没空理你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "杜宾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "走！去第一汇合点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "各小队！动作要快！快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来啊！感染者混球！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们就这点本事吗？只会站在那里看着吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "切尔诺伯格人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "该死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
